</section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwCJ8" aria-labelledby="Height_to_occupied_floor"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Height_to_occupied_floor">Height to occupied floor</h3></div>
<figure typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwCKA"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Highest_occupied_floor_2022.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwCKE"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Highest_occupied_floor_2022.png" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Highest_occupied_floor_2022.png/500px-Highest_occupied_floor_2022.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Highest_occupied_floor_2022.png/960px-Highest_occupied_floor_2022.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="3052" data-file-height="1250" data-file-type="bitmap" height="164" width="400" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCKI"/></a><figcaption id="mwCKM">Tallest buildings by highest occupied floor in 2022.</figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwCKQ">This height is measured to the highest occupiable floor within the building.<sup about="#mwt561" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:1_10-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:1-10" id="mwCKU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCKY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCKc">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCKg">]</span></span></a></sup>
