</section><section data-mw-section-id="12" id="mwEq8" aria-labelledby="Countries_with_most_buildings_on_list"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Countries_with_most_buildings_on_list">Countries with most buildings on list</h2></div>
